TEXT 80 400 Left 2 ;3.3V LDO Power Supply for ESP32
TEXT 80 430 Left 2 ;Input: 5V USB. Output: 3.3V @ 100mA max for ESP32 + BQ76920
TEXT 80 460 Left 2 ;AMS1117-3.3 / LT1117-3.3 compatible LDO regulator
TEXT 80 490 Left 2 ;C_IN = 10uF bulk, C_OUT = 100uF + 100nF bypass
